-/// Put the choice's linear forms on t's wires: t1 <- dq = t1^b1, t_i <- z_i = t_i^b_i^dq (i = 2,3,4; the deep
-/// candidate's bits: -b mod 32 is ~b with bit 0 set, and the carries into bits 2..4 are 1 wherever they are read),
